OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly and bright start to
OL,6,FWednesday, with any isolated mist or
OL,7,Ffog patches soon clearing. Becoming
OL,8,Frather warm through the morning, with
OL,9,Fsome patchy cloud developing during
OL,10,Fthe afternoon. Winds remaining mostly
OL,11,Flight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSome clear spells to start on
OL,14,FWednesday night, but soon becoming
OL,15,Fmostly cloudy, though remaining dry.
OL,16,FWinds light at first but soon becoming
OL,17,Fbreezy. Generally mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
